Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Example 1 (Section 7.1)", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"ffc5524f-e23d-4b61-8ae7-ad5a185133f8"],

Cell["\<\
The input is the GTP, given as a list of edges ; and the list of 7-branes. \
Here there is a single 7-brane, so the list contains a single element, which \
is a pair : the first entry  {0, 1} is the charge of the brane, the second \
one {{0, 0}, {1, -2}} is the path followed by (one side of) the cut which \
defines the Symington polygon. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002185385925786*^9, 
  4.002185500329612*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7f5c59e6-722a-427b-8bb2-\
1587fff64718"],

